^{:go/end 241} (go/func byteSliceInsertConstantBytes "byteSliceInsertConstantBytes inserts a chunk of constant bytes into a random position in b.\n" ^{:tag (slice byte)} [^{:tag (* mutator)} m ^{:tag (slice byte)} b]
